<head>
<no>12</no><heading guid="_60728e2a-aba8-40fc-aada-fff103838a6a"
id="sec.12-he"><b>Audit by Auditor-General of payments from the
Fund</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The audit of the accounts relating to the Fund by
the Auditor-General under the <legref refid="act-1983-152" jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Government Sector Audit Act
1983</i></name></legref> is to include an audit of the payments made from the
Fund under this Act.</txt></block>

